---
layout: '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
title: "Your Finding Title"
---

<article class="max-w-3xl space-y-12">
  {/* Back Navigation */}
  <a href="/nexus/findings" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted hover:text-accent-cyan transition-colors group">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
    </svg>
    Back to Findings
  </a>

  {/* Header Section */}
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <span class="tag accent">Category</span>
      <span class="text-sm text-muted font-mono">2026-09-19</span>
    </div>
    
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary leading-tight">
      Your Finding Title Here
    </h1>
    
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-muted" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1" />
        </svg>
        Source: Your Source
      </span>
      <a 
        href="https://example.com" 
        target="_blank" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-accent-cyan/10 border border-accent-cyan/30 text-accent-cyan rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-cyan/20 transition-colors text-sm font-medium"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
        </svg>
        Visit Source
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Main Content */}
  <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      Start writing your findings here with detailed notes about your discovery.
    </p>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
        Key Points
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-secondary">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-cyan mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
          <span>Your first key point goes here with more detail and context.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-cyan mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
          <span>Your second key point with supporting information.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-cyan mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
          <span>Third important insight from this discovery.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
        Personal Notes
      </h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Add your personal reflections, use cases, or additional context here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Tags Section */}
  <div class="pt-8 border-t border-border-subtle">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-muted" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z" />
      </svg>
      <span class="text-sm text-muted font-mono">TAGS</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="tag accent">#tag1</span>
      <span class="tag accent">#tag2</span>
      <span class="tag">#tag3</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Meta Footer */}
  <div class="pt-8 border-t border-border-subtle flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-muted font-mono">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <span>DISCOVERED: 2026-09-19</span>
      <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-muted"></span>
      <span>NX-003</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
      </svg>
      <span>Knowledge Base</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
